    "provenance":  {
                       "change_commit":  "48ac8521a2f1094e81453f5d65d756e035b6ab15",
                       "reason":  "fix06_28 preserves the already authenticated scenario semantic inventory on room revisit so a later validated dynamic delivery handoff cannot erase or rewrite the room seal; no schema or Crew state changed.",
                       "proof":  "Full-value captures from 25d9231d and 48ac8521 were recursively compared after normalizing only the fixed-width private Crew capsule. Both seeds were byte-identical at initial_bar, bar_action_boundary, and ordinary_travel. At bar_revisit and save_load_round_trip the only two changed paths were world_map.nodes[0].environment.scenario_semantic_inventory and the same Bar environment in world_environments; zero changed paths contained Crew data. Same-seed twins, inactive world-sequence/Crew no-ops, and zero Crew trust remain mandatory."
                   },
